msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipChild is functional"
msgstr "relationshipChild est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipChild is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one child, the single younger party of the dyadic relator."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:relationshipChild est fonctionnelle : une relation parent-enfant réifiée désigne exactement un enfant, l'unique partie cadette du relateur dyadique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "relationshipParent is functional"
msgstr "relationshipParent est fonctionnelle"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipParent is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one parent, so a child's two parents are two ParentChildRelationship relators rather than one relator carrying two parents."
msgstr "Affirme sur le porteur canonique que gmeow:relationshipParent est fonctionnelle : une relation parent-enfant réifiée désigne exactement un parent, de sorte que les deux parents d'un enfant sont deux relateurs ParentChildRelationship plutôt qu'un seul relateur portant deux parents."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:relationshipChild names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "À utiliser lorsque le portail de cohérence natif doit garantir que gmeow:relationshipChild nomme exactement une valeur ; cet enregistrement est le porteur canonique que le portail joint, de sorte que l'obligation est raisonnée plutôt que redite sur une surface de formes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "À éviter lorsque une seconde valeur rendrait l'enregistrement ambigu — retirez l'assertion plutôt que de l'affaiblir, et ne la reproduisez jamais sous forme de forme écrite à la main."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:relationshipChild, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "À lire avec logic:characteristicSort : le couple (logic:characterizes gmeow:relationshipChild, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) constitue l'obligation entière, et la vue de fondement OWL en projette la caractéristique correspondante."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:relationshipChildFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:relationshipChild ."
msgstr "gmeow:relationshipChildFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:relationshipChild ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
